{"track":"r","category":"함수·재귀","level":2,"title":"짝수만 남기기 (Filter)","desc":"<p><code>Filter()</code>를 사용해서 벡터에서 짝수만 남긴 벡터를 돌려주는 <code>keep_even(x)</code>를 만드세요.</p>","solution":"keep_even <- function(x) {\n  Filter(function(v) v %% 2 == 0, x)\n}\n","hint":"<p><code>Filter(조건 함수, 벡터)</code> — 조건 함수가 TRUE인 원소만 남겨요.</p>","tests":[{"call":"keep_even(c(1, 2, 3, 4))","expected":[2,4],"visible":true},{"call":"keep_even(c(1, 3))","expected":[],"visible":true},{"call":"keep_even(c(2, 4))","expected":[2,4],"visible":false},{"call":"keep_even(c(6, 7, 8))","expected":[6,8],"visible":false}],"starter":"keep_even <- function(x) {\n  \n}\n","id":"r-342"}